    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>THE CANDLE</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your candle burns in real-time over up to 4 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once its light goes out, it cannot be lit again</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>THE CASTLE</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the decrepit manor and rummage through drawers for loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid 4 unique spooky scary monsters on your quest to reach the hidden chamber</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>THE CARNIVAL</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 6 different minigames at the carny's stalls for tickets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange your tickets at the carnival office for fun prizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make allies or build rivalries with those who remain</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><u>===================================================================</u></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CONTROLS</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc / Spacebar: Settings + Inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD: Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift: Sprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E: Interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click: Throw / Fire Weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Click: Inspect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Click + F: Blow Out Candle (If Lit)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>THE CANDLE</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your candle burns in real-time over up to 4 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once its light goes out, it cannot be lit again</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>THE CASTLE</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the decrepit manor and rummage through drawers for loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid 4 unique spooky scary monsters on your quest to reach the hidden chamber</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>THE CARNIVAL</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 6 different minigames at the carny's stalls for tickets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange your tickets at the carnival office for fun prizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make allies or build rivalries with those who remain</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><u>===================================================================</u></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CONTROLS</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc / Spacebar: Settings + Inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD: Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift: Sprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E: Interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click: Throw / Fire Weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Click: Inspect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Click + F: Blow Out Candle (If Lit)</p>",
    "short_description": "The Candle - Rated R. As night falls and a storm rises over the annual county carnival, you are visited by a mysterious spirit. Tasked with laying his soul to rest, you must brave his long dilapidated manor and avoid the horrifying remnants of his estate staff.",
